{
  "slug": "copilot-bridge",
  "name": "Copilot Bridge",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "MCP bridge that lets Claude Code delegate coding tasks to GitHub Copilot CLI. Forwards prompts to the locally installed\nCopilot CLI and returns results. Includes a /copilot skill for on-demand or automatic delegation of code generation,\ndebugging, refactoring, test writing, and shell work.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `copilot` (Default executor for coding tasks) and **1 MCP server**, `copilot-bridge`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install copilot-bridge@claude-community` from `StreetStripe/delegate-claude-to-copilot`.\n\n**Free Copilot, but you *really* like working with Claude Code?<br>Bridge them.**",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
